From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Haze <patches@haze.invalid>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:27:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Build Haze's sources into the browser

Why: Gives Haze's own code a single entry point in the Chromium build graph,
so every later step adds its deps inside //haze instead of touching chrome/
again. One dep line is also the cheapest thing to carry across a rebase.
Security-relevant: no
Area: core
---
 chrome/browser/BUILD.gn | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn b/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn
index 570de6f..dbe95b8 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/browser/BUILD.gn
@@ -2771,6 +2771,7 @@ source_set("browser") {
     "//device/gamepad/public/cpp:switches",
     "//google_apis",
     "//gpu/config",
+    "//haze",
     "//media",
     "//media/capture",
     "//media/capture:capture_switches",
